      "body": "read : \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/nextcloud/ios/issues/215\r\n\r\np.s. Your post is not correct, the system dot use the \" traditional GPS\" but the Cell radios\r\n\r\nhttps://developer.apple.com/documentation/corelocation/cllocationmanager\r\n\r\n> For example, setting the desired accuracy for location events to one kilometer gives the location manager the flexibility to turn off GPS hardware and rely solely on the WiFi or cell radios, which can lead to significant power savings.\r\n \r\n",
