      "body": "Could be true - I'm not in the code. The app request GPS from me and the description does not tell anything about Cell radios. The battery drain is EXTREME and I still see no reason why this is needed. Only WLAN on/off is an indicator that should start the sync... normally. At least I do not have a 100GB LTE flat on mobile... :). I do not get the design idea why my movement should start a sync. Whereever I am, after the photo is taken it should be uploaded if there is wlan. if no wlan, wait until wlan comes up and than sync. To detect a wlan goes on and off you should not require my position... also if one kilometer inaccurate.",
